<h2>Inital Dissection</h2>
For MAE 3260, the Fluid Dynamics course, we are given an object and must find at least one fluid component to analyze wihtin that object. We were given a chainsaw and in the dissection process, we came across many fluid mechanical devices: fuel lines & containers, a venturi within the carburetor, a combustion chamber, roller bearings, and journal bearings. 

For our analysis we have decided to focus on the carburetor, in turn incorporating information about the combustion chamber. 

